  "zip_caveats": "Pflugerville straddles the Travis/Williamson line. Most of 78660 is Travis County and votes the Travis ballot (county judge Andy Brown, JPs, TCAD directors). The northern part of 78660 is Williamson County: those voters use apps.wilcotx.gov/elections/voterlookup and see the Williamson county judge (Snell vs. Jefts), county clerk and Commissioner Pct 4 or 2 instead. Both halves vote on Pflugerville City Council and the 14 city charter amendments, and on Pflugerville ISD trustees. The ACC annexation measure appears only for PfISD-area voters outside the current ACC taxing district. Congress: most of Pflugerville is in CD-11 after the 2025 redraw (Labor Council lists Pflugerville under CD-11); some precincts may fall in CD-10 or CD-27. Texas House is HD-46 or HD-50.",
